        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Disposal, cooker hood, kitchen
na;
UUID: 89214ded-0cb2-3119-80ce-d1d9bf9cbca4
This data set includes the disposal of the kitchen cooker hood. All metalic parts are recycled. 8.4 kg waste is disposed of. It is assumed that 10% are electronics and cables, 70% are plastics (PE) from the ventilator and 20% are mixed plastics.  Transport to the incineration plant is included.; Geography: Data valid for Switzerland
Location: Data valid for Switzerland
Technology: Average disposal
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: unknown 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_89214ded-0cb2-3119-80ce-d1d9bf9cbca4.xml</text>
